category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6 libzipios2 zlib0
sdesc: "C++ library for reading and writing Zip files using streams (utilities)"
ldesc: "Zipios is a small C++ library for reading and writing zip files.
The structure and public interface are based (somewhat loosely) on the
java.util.zip package. The streams created to access the individual entries in a
zip file are based on the standard iostream library."

